    "description": "<p>Spikes of kinetic energy surround the target, harming them if they try to move.</p><p>Choose a target within<strong> 10 spaces</strong>. Until the start of your next turn, the target takes <strong>1 Damage</strong> each time it <strong>Moves</strong>, takes the <strong>Charge</strong> or <strong>Run</strong> action, or is moved by another effect.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can increase the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.1lyqbkunoOqilYs4]{Force Prison}</p>",
